{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:302","content":{"id":302,"title":"以我为主","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"57eef430-c684-416f-9a74-70136f1c312d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一会儿积累这方面的知识，一会儿积累那方面的知识，墙头草，不知道自己的方向。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2dcbb107-1612-4f17-8196-7d7f290fb5a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个原则：以我为主，增援未来的自己，未来的自己会怎么用，未来想成为什么样的人，以终为始。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"94d7e82d-61b2-486a-8b26-741499e12aa2","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c6d6f799-d016-4ebe-ab72-4cb63ec54e8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"61ca697f-6e20-4a53-a735-8c96f91b96ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学海无涯，专业的事情交给专业的人去做，专注我们领域的知识"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e38c6a4d-05c9-4e09-9341-c7705daf7737","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c6e86be1-6659-4416-b42a-78f615bb4db9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学屠龙技，也要有龙可屠，从当前问题出发"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"430a52f8-7c34-4abc-965b-de591794c617","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7a7fa557-84b2-440d-904a-451016713c2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"知行合一，下场实践"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}},{"label":"以我为主","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}}],"prevPage":{"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}},"nextPage":{"title":"持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:303","type":"doc","id":303}},"createTime":1743911879809,"updateTime":1792337091230,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792337091230}}